  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to voluntary return and monitoring of migration flows in Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to provide assistance by offering basic services to migrants stranded in Niger who have chosen to return voluntarily to their country of origin, including help with socio-economic reintegration. The project is in line with Denmark&apos;s political priority of combating irregular migration and providing more effective assistance to a greater number of vulnerable and distressed migrants along the main migration routes, as set out in the Danish development strategy &quot;The World We Share&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
